      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-gothru-dashboard-4237",
      "display_title": "Issue #4237: feat(match-menu): Display specific icons based on menu item type in match sidebar",
      "main_description_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Ref: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5384950331\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/GoThru-API-New/issues/1841\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/GoThru-API-New/issues/1841/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/GoThru-API-New/issues/1841\">GoThruMedia/GoThru-API-New#1841</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5373559887\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4235\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4235/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4235\">#4235</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">API V2 (<code class=\"notranslate\">GET /v2/templates/menu/match</code>) now returns explicit menu item types (<code class=\"notranslate\">pano</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">text</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">link</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">hotspot</code>). This task updates <code class=\"notranslate\">gothru-dashboard</code> to:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Capture <code class=\"notranslate\">item.type</code> in <code class=\"notranslate\">useMatchMenus</code> and restrict template matching strictly to <code class=\"notranslate\">type: \"pano\"</code>.</li>\n<li>Display dedicated icons and type badges for all menu nodes in the Match Menu sidebar.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Key Changes</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong><code class=\"notranslate\">src/hooks/useMatchMenus.jsx</code></strong>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Preserved <code class=\"notranslate\">menu_type</code> from API (<code class=\"notranslate\">item.type</code>).</li>\n<li>Marked non-pano nodes (<code class=\"notranslate\">text</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">link</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">hotspot</code>) as non-matchable containers (<code class=\"notranslate\">isContainer: true</code>).</li>\n<li>Updated <code class=\"notranslate\">hasMatchablePano()</code> to only count nodes with <code class=\"notranslate\">type: \"pano\"</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">template_pano_id &gt; 0</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong><code class=\"notranslate\">src/components/organism/SideMenu/MatchMenu.jsx</code></strong>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Rendered all menu nodes in unified card boxes with tree hierarchy guidelines.</li>\n<li>Added specific icons and badges:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">pano</code>: <code class=\"notranslate\">fa-regular fa-image</code> + match status indicator</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">text</code>: <code class=\"notranslate\">fa-regular fa-font</code> + <code class=\"notranslate\">TEXT</code> badge</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">link</code>: <code class=\"notranslate\">fa-regular fa-link</code> + <code class=\"notranslate\">LINK</code> badge</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">hotspot</code>: <code class=\"notranslate\">fa-regular fa-bullseye-pointer</code> + <code class=\"notranslate\">HOTSPOT</code> badge</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Result</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>PR</strong>: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5386154909\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4238\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/pull/4238/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/pull/4238\">#4238</a></li>\n<li><strong>Commit</strong>: <code class=\"notranslate\">00c606fdb</code></li>\n<li><strong>Tests</strong>: 16/16 unit tests passed.</li>\n</ul>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">Screencast.From.2026-09-08.18-47-11.webm</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"videos/video-1de771d2-096b-4ce7-963d-b5c275d0cfab.webm\" data-canonical-src=\"videos/video-1de771d2-096b-4ce7-963d-b5c275d0cfab.webm\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n",
